# `task build:web` copies the built Flutter web bundle here so Quarkus serves it same-origin
# with the API, and the native build bakes it into the image. The bundle is a build artifact,
# not source — it is rebuilt from apps/zen_demo/zen_demo_client — so none of it is tracked.
#
# Only openapi.yaml is tracked: it is the hand-authored static OpenAPI schema that the SmallRye
# merge reads (STANDARDS "OpenAPI and the REST surface"), not something a build produces.
*
!.gitignore
!openapi.yaml
